# Build hygiene (ym752): backups must never ship in the image. A bare `*.bak*` only
# matches the build-context root, so the **/ variants are the ones that cover
# packages/**/src backups (the ym739 image leak).
*.bak*
*.bak-*
**/*.bak*
**/*.bak-*
